combo system, and a local leaderboard<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Additional Features</h2></li><li>A locker room where you can customize yourself, view your stats, and take a rest<br></li><li>Unlock new outfits, gloves, and hand poses by progressing in the game<br></li><li>Choose between four different gyms to workout in<br></li><li>Steam Leaderboard Integration<br></li><li>Five new songs to motivate you through your intense gains<br></li><li>No microtransactions :)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1027190/extras/fa74ecc02f819d93678ddd7e6adecd38.avif?t=1699293826\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Supporting RAICES</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1027190/extras/9af2dcabee60325bdb7d991f72e536b4.avif?t=1699293826\" /></div>",
